{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"MARQUEEさん発売中です！\nオフショットどーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現場に行く途中の道が\nところどころボコボコしていて\nヒール履いてる私は何度も\nこけそうになりました...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........................................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋で握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年半前、関西の方の握手会は\n正直すごく憂鬱で前の日は\n寝れませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに人も来てくれなくて\n水を飲みながら気を紛らわしたり\nもう常に泣きそうになってて\nこの先どうすればいいのかと\n悩んだくらいでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最近は完売が出たり\n今回も来てくれた皆さんが\nものすごい笑顔で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「列が凄いことになってるよ！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私同様に喜んでくれて\nなんか言葉に出来ない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力・感謝・笑顔\nこの言葉を胸に頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手羽先が差し入れで来てて\n未央奈とたくさん食べた！\n美味しかった(^ｑ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数が少なかったので少し我慢した...\n偉いよね...だよね...はは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋めし食べたいなー\nきしめんも美味しそう！\n味噌カツは凄く美味しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回に引き続き\n6月誕生日の方は教えてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いてて思ったんだけど\n5・6月生まれの方が多いなぁと思いました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の写真で一言は\n今回のブログの1枚目の写真！\nスクロールした一番上にある\n写真だよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『前回の写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.32 まつへ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日草刈りしたのに..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.43 たいやき君♪ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが人間のいう猫じゃらしというやつか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.65 nocchi(グレー@川後Ｐ命名) さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を隠そうこれが渡辺みり愛の10年後\nの姿なのである。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.69 悠人＠OLBBA推し さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年後の猫部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.77 ぽんこつ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛「ねこちゃんどこー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫「いや、俺さ一応分かり易いようなところ\nに隠れたつもりなんだわ。\nいつになったら見つけてくれるん？\nけっこうまってますよ？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.99 しゅうったん。 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NASAに追われてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.126 ごまきな さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫A「右斜め前方200メートルに\nみり愛発見！猫B応答どうぞ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫B「情報ではみり愛は三丁目の魚屋で\n鮪を買った模様」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫A「今日の晩御飯は決まった。\n距離20メートルで急襲する」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.162 かさいちゃん臨海公園 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、ぼく野良猫ではなく田中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.174 匿名 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋元康先生、「無口な野良猫」という\n渡辺みり愛ソロ曲、待ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.224 たっくん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未来が眩しくて見えないぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.245 きなこじじい。 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛さん、これ出演料\nいただけるんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.273 これとーさん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！またさゆレンジャーが戦ってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.356 ゆうちゃん師匠 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺んち広いやろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.414 にょい さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枯らす能力"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.436 ししょ〜＠レスリー さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫「草をた「くさ」ん食べれるとか笑えない\nギャグを言いながらここに案内\nされたけどワシ、肉派やねん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.535 かわ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ってどこ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.555 福くん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここが俺のベストプレイスだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.591 たかちん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふんっ。俺を拾ってみやがれ。\nこの人間どもが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.634 イノキは美しい さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪無口なにゃんこ〜\n今日は骨ないんだね〜\nずうと座ったまま〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？どこか違うニャー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.686 Goldberg Variations さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あばよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！今回多し。\nありがとうございます(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/16/4467554/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき道を歩いてたら\n反対側から小学生達が歩いてきて\n可愛いなぁって思ってたら\nあの...身長が同じくらいでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、ほらみんな成長期だしね、\nあのーね、ほら、うん、ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( .. )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}